    proy_title: "Projects",
    proy_intro: "Oral storytelling projects already carried out around the world — programmes, series, interventions and training processes with institutional backing — each with its full record: what it did, who carried it out, where, when, with what resources and what results, with sources in plain sight. Amounts are published with the label their source gives them (requested, declared cost, fund ceiling or executed income), because the actual disbursement is almost never on record.",
