    inter_title: "Exchange",
    inter_intro: "This is the board of the network: proposals for collaborations, exchanges and tours among the storytellers and festivals of the map are published here. Every record on the map carries the public contact channels of its storyteller or festival, so you can write to them directly; and proposals meant to reach the whole network are published on this board.",
    inter_board_t: "Proposal board",
    inter_f_all: "All", inter_f_colab: "Collaborations", inter_f_inter: "Exchanges", inter_f_gira: "Tours",
    inter_form_t: "Publish a proposal",
    inter_form_intro: "Fill in the form and your email will open with the proposal ready to send to the Foundation. The Foundation verifies it and publishes it on the board; nothing is published automatically. Only publish contact details you accept as public.",
    inter_l_nombre: "Your name or your festival", inter_l_pais: "Country", inter_l_tipo: "Type of proposal", inter_l_titulo: "Proposal title", inter_l_ofrece: "What you offer", inter_l_busca: "What you seek", inter_l_fechas: "Dates or availability", inter_l_contacto: "Contact to publish (public email or link)", inter_l_publico: "I accept that this proposal and this contact be published on the board.",
    inter_btn: "Prepare the proposal email",
    inter_como_t: "How exchange works",
    inter_como: "There are two paths that complement each other. The direct one: every storyteller profile and every festival record carries its public channels, and you can write to them without intermediaries. The board path: you publish your proposal here, the Foundation verifies it, and it stays visible to the whole network, with your public contact so people can write to you. Proposals are withdrawn whenever you ask, just like records.",
