    colab_title: "Contributors",
    colab_intro: "The people who make this map: as soon as someone contributes —adds a record, edits one, publishes a piece of news or has a proposal applied— they appear here automatically, with what they contributed and when. With no one intervening by hand and no one highlighted above others.",
    colab_empty: "No contributors published yet —",
    colab_empty_link: "be one of the first!",
    blog_title: "Blog",
    blog_intro: "Articles and reflections on the craft, written by the community's storytellers and by the map team: festival chronicles, interviews, theory and practice of oral storytelling, reviews. Every voice and current of the craft, with no exclusions by affinity. Once registration exists, every storyteller will be able to publish from their account, with moderation under the published criteria.",
    blog_empty: "No articles published yet.",
    foro_title: "Forum",
    foro_intro: "Horizontal conversation between storytellers: technique, festivals, collaborations, resources and questions about the craft. Public to read; writing requires registration. Spam and aggression are moderated, never dissent or criticism.",
    foro_empty: "No threads opened yet.",
    foro_replies: "replies",
    nos_title: "About us",
    nos_intro: "This map is a gathering: it is made by the storytellers, the festivals and the communities who tell stories all over the world. Nobody stands above anybody else: every record has the same place, and every person who tells a story adds to it.",
    nos_quote: "“We want to drive a world with more storytelling, and we think joining together is the best we can do.”",
    nos_invite: "We invite you to sign up, update your details, improve your record and propose: new festivals, corrections and news. Once registration exists, you will be able to do it directly from your account.",
    nos_fundacion: "Costa Rican oral storytelling foundation. Its Festival Internacional Puro Cuento was born in 2002 and its next edition, the 19th, takes place 13–21 March 2027. A project driven by the Fundación Festival Puro Cuento.",
    foto_label: "Photo",
